			<font face="arial" size="-1" color="#000000">The April 19th PoG raid got off to shakey ground as only 2 groups of people came to partcipate. <br>Most of the people had been to the previous raid so the quality was still there. <br>After a smooth break in, the MA Fuogly began searching for pulls. <br>Mobs were scarce and spread out due to other groups hunting the zone the prior evening. <br>This made things stay at a medium pace for most of the raid. <br>After a few hours of moving around and pulling mobs, the raid leaders decided to take a chance and pull a named Treant Mob. <br>The Mob went down and a Rogue Breastplate dropped WOOT! <br>The raid leaders decided to clear to the other side of the zone and pull the other named Treant. <br>That Treant went down as well as several of our raiding force. <br>The Treant dropped a Mages Robe that Chromedian for NATO rushed to zone for. <br>As the raid was about to end another Mage Robe dropped of a common mob. WOOT <br>As the raiding group kicked back from clearing most of the zone another guild entered the Plane and began making their way to Tunare. <br>Several members stuck around to watch the death of the goody goody. One lucky raid participant was able to loot pants off a mob they dropped (Cleric Pants). <br> <br>It was another great day for TaO and the NATO alliance. <br>We hope to see you there next week. <br> <br>KIMBAA</font></td>
